dWJ5Lm9yLmpwPgpEYXRlOiBGcmksIDggSnVsIDIwMjIgMjE6NTc6MDUgKzA5MDAKU3ViamVjdDog
W1BBVENIXSBudW1lcmljLmMgKGNtcG51bSk6IGNhbGwgbXJiX2JpZ2ludF9jbXAoKSBpZiB2MSBp
cyBiaWdpbnQsCiBub3QgdjIuCgotLS0KIHNyYy9udW1lcmljLmMgfCAyICstCiAxIGZpbGUgY2hh
bmdlZCwgMSBpbnNlcnRpb24oKyksIDEgZGVsZXRpb24oLSkKCmRpZmYgLS1naXQgYS9zcmMvbnVt
ZXJpYy5jIGIvc3JjL251bWVyaWMuYwppbmRleCAyN2E3Y2I4YzMuLjdjODc1NGU0OSAxMDA2NDQK
LS0tIGEvc3JjL251bWVyaWMuYworKysgYi9zcmMvbnVtZXJpYy5jCkBAIC0xODAxLDcgKzE4MDEs
NyBAQCBzdGF0aWMgbXJiX2ludAogY21wbnVtKG1yYl9zdGF0ZSAqbXJiLCBtcmJfdmFsdWUgdjEs
IG1yYl92YWx1ZSB2MikKIHsKICNpZmRlZiBNUkJfVVNFX0JJR0lOVAotICBpZiAobXJiX2JpZ2lu
dF9wKHYyKSkgeworICBpZiAobXJiX2JpZ2ludF9wKHYxKSkgewogICAgIHJldHVybiBtcmJfYmlu
